          "term": "demonstrated",
          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "We have demonstrated on three examples of hyperbolic knots, that the link invariant, defined in [@K1; @K2] via cyclic quantum dilogarithm, in the asymptotic limit $N\\to\\infty$ reproduces the hyperbolic volume of a knot, see formula ([\\[main\\]](#main){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"main\"}). This result implies a possible relation of the corresponding combinatorial TQFT to quantum 2+1-dimensional gravity.",
      "extractCut": false
